  "body": "Positioned in the sought-after Pacific Heights stage, 57 Matangi View Drive presents a beautifully designed three-level home, approximately 4 years old and tailored for modern family living. Spanning approximately 286m² of floor area plus 17m² of decking, this impressive residence offers space, flexibility, and comfort for growing families.\r\n\r\nThe lower level provides a private and versatile setup, featuring two bedrooms, a separate living area, bathroom, and its own deck—perfect for extended family, guests, or independent living, with the added benefit of side access. The main level showcases expansive open-plan living with a stylish contemporary kitchen, dining, and lounge flowing effortlessly onto a timber deck that captures lovely sea views. This level also includes two generous bedrooms, a well-appointed family bathroom, an internal double garage, and a laundry.\r\n\r\nOn the upper level, you’ll find a luxurious master retreat complete with a spacious bedroom, an elegant ensuite with a bathtub, a walk-in wardrobe, and a separate sitting area—ideal for relaxing in your own private space.\r\n\r\nQuality finishes are featured throughout, and for added peace of mind, the property comes with a 1-year maintenance period along with the remaining term of the Master Build Guarantee. Located in a desirable Orewa community, you’ll enjoy elevated living with sea views, easy access to State Highway 1, public transport from Hibiscus Coast Station, and a wide selection of local schools, cafés, and coastal amenities just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out - enquire today and make your dream lifestyle a reality!",
